## Vendor frameworks (proprietary JieLi/RTK stacks — see Vendor/README.md) ##
## Public-domain FMDB sources have moved to Sources/ThirdParty/FMDB/ and ##
## are tracked; only the NDA-licensed binary frameworks stay ignored.   ##
Vendor/JWBle.framework/
Vendor/RTKAudioConnectSDK.framework/
Vendor/RTKLEFoundation.framework/
Vendor/RTKOTASDK.framework/
Vendor/CocoaLumberjack.framework/

## Local-only vendor cache populated by scripts/bootstrap.sh ##
Vendor/.cache/

## Pre-2026.5.28 layout: FMDB lived under Vendor/FMDB/. The four files ##
## that the build needs now live in Sources/ThirdParty/FMDB/. Any      ##
## leftover Vendor/FMDB/ from an older checkout is harmless and stays  ##
## untracked so it doesn't confuse `git status` output.                ##
Vendor/FMDB/

## fastlane ##
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

